---
description: Performance and accessibility
globs: "{src/**,index.html}"
alwaysApply: false
---

- Use `svh`/`dvh` with `vh` fallback; explicit width/height on media.
- Videos: `muted`, `playsinline`, handle `play()` rejection, poster fallback.
- Animate `transform` and `opacity` only; no `position: fixed` scroll hacks.
- Bulgarian `alt` text; focus-visible styles; contrast via gradients on imagery.
